Colorcet 3.2.1 by the HoloViz developers and Peter Kovesi
https://github.com/holoviz/colorcet/tree/v3.2.1
https://colorcet.holoviz.org/user_guide/Categorical.html

The glasbey_category10 RGB palette is copied as 8-bit RGB triples.
It starts with the classic Category10 colors, then extends them using Glasbey color separation.
The application blends colors for dark backgrounds; no runtime dependency or network access is required.
